// VALIDATION RULES
// 1. Every player must have a name, pos, team, league, era, ovr, and source.
// 2. ovr must be 0-99. pac/sho/pas/dri/def/phy must be 0-99.
// 3. pos must be one of the position codes (GK, RB, LB, CB1, CB2, CDM, CM, CAM, RW, LW, ST, plus depth codes).
// 3. team must be one of the official team names from the LEAGUES list.
// 4. league must be one of the target leagues.
// 5. era must be a season string (e.g., "2024-25") or era for all-time.
// 6. xf is optional (null or omitted if no X-factor).
// 7. source must explain how the rating was derived (source name, method, confidence).
// 8. No duplicate players (same name + team).
// 9. Position balance: aim for ~22 players per position across all leagues.
// 10. Total players: ~1,500-2,000 (target per Owner).